  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "59092380-0279-cf0d-8b23-f1430eb1cd77",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "7b8688dc-c1a4-139c-e416-c2f14d20d695",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The seminar was facilitated by Dr. Klodiana Kolomitro, Director of Education Development, Professional Development and Educational Scholarship in the Faculty of Health Sciences. She is cross-appointed to the Department of Biomedical and Molecular Sciences at Queen's University, Canada.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "During the session, Dr. Kolomitro discussed different strategies that influence the way we approach curriculum renewal processes including, involving our stakeholders, establishing practices and timelines, and adopting evidence-based pedagogies with high-impact practices. The presentation was followed by a Question and Answer session, in which faculty members raised important concerns regarding curriculum review processes at AKU. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "83 faculty members and staff - across 3 continents - participated in the session from the following entities:",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet_list",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "School of Nursing and Midwifery - Pakistan ",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
