    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The renewal of curriculum design is an intentional, on-going, systematic process aimed at making informed curricular decisions to provide students with learning experiences that are transformational, inspiring, and intellectually stimulating. A number of entities at AKU are currently under-going curriculum review.  To support this process, the Network of Quality, Teaching and Learning (QTL_net) organized a webinar on 'Inspiring Change through Curriculum Renewal' on May 28th, 2020.",
